NAME
       cmp - compare two files byte by byte

SYNOPSIS
       cmp [-sl] FILE1 [FILE2]

DESCRIPTION
       Report the first byte and line where FILE1 and FILE2 differ. Exit status
       0 if equal, 1 if different, 2 on error.

OPTIONS
       -s
           print nothing, only return the exit status

       -l
           print every differing byte

EXAMPLES
       cmp a.bin b.bin

SEE ALSO
       diff(1)
